      "reply": "The resend that has the later `YYYYMMDD_HHMM` timestamp in its file name wins. The loader parses the timestamp from the name (`SUBMITTERID_YYYYMMDD_HHMM_NAME.txt`) and orders files descending; the row from the **latest submitter file** is kept\u202f[4]. If timestamps are identical, the lexically greater file name would win\u202f[4].",
